architecture financial-metabolism
  canonical_name FinancialMetabolism
  family economic
  domain Economic / Financial Metabolism
  layer economic/finance
  semantic_question How does observed usage become accrued economics, funding selection and basis-explicit position without becoming booked truth?
  purpose Extends MoneyGraph and InstitutionalCostGraph with receipt-bound multi-dimensional UsageOccurrence, versioned EconomicMeasure, traversable CostAllocation, FundingCircuit, FinancialPosition, DerivationEconomics and ChangeEconomics while preserving accrued, estimated, billed, paid, booked and credit bases.
  maturity implemented
  owns UsageOccurrence
  owns FundingCircuit
  owns FinancialPosition
  owns DerivationEconomics
  owns ChangeEconomics
  owns EconomicMeasure
  owns CostAllocation
  owns FinancialEvent
  consumes PhysicalDerivationReceipt
  consumes CommercialAgreement
  publishes FinancialPosition
  node_types UsageOccurrence
  node_types FundingRoute
  node_types FinancialPosition
  node_types FinancialEvent
  edge_types valued_by
  edge_types funded_by
  edge_types projects_position
  edge_types allocates
  invariant usage requires a physical receipt and admitted rate source before cost accrues
  invariant funding availability never supplies spend authority
  invariant unknown provider price remains an explicit unknown EconomicMeasure, never zero or billed money
  invariant provider, technical account, billing account and agreement are separate usage coordinates
  invariant priced EconomicMeasure binds evidenced effective_at and observed_at price coordinates; a later FinancialEvent never rewrites the estimate
  invariant carrier usage binds a stable physical attempt and realization; exact replay is idempotent while a changed attempt payload is refused, except source-backed absent-to-present model/route enrichment
  invariant aggregate Codex usage preserves terminal model/route coordinates only when declared by the terminal event or explicit launcher manifest; an implicit CLI default remains unknown
  invariant a v2 terminal epoch receipt retains verified carrier command metadata and optional provider/model/route coordinates after compaction; a v5 hash-only manifest leaves missing coordinates unknown
  invariant CostAllocation names an allocation version; shared or cached realization never becomes a cash-saving claim merely by attribution
  invariant known provider pricing matches the pricing evidence bound to the usage attempt; absent pricing evidence remains unknown
  invariant fractional allocations for one measure and allocation version cannot exceed one; unknown fractions remain null
  forbidden_inference accrued cost -> billed, paid, or booked money
  internal_calculus a price enters the store only as an admitted rate carrying a provider, a unit, an amount, the date it took effect and the evidence that admitted it; usage the estate has no such rate for is metered and left unpriced
  internal_calculus an event carries the time the usage happened rather than the time it was written, so a rate admitted today never reaches back to price work done before it took effect
  internal_calculus accrual is reported per unit and never summed across them: a provider billing in credits and one billing in dollars do not add to an amount owed in either
  source_path cmd/BonfyreMeter/src/main.c
  source_path scripts/publish_economics.py.archive
  source_path scripts/publish_economics.mjs
  source_path scripts/tests/publish_economics_test.sh
  source_path cmd/BonfyreMeter/tests/physical_attempt_test.sh
