  witness 2026-09-19 what the membrane shows is published at /economics on every territory the worker serves and under each subject host running programs, wearing the estate's own stylesheet and carrying the accrual boundary in the page and in a bonfyre:cannot-infer meta
  witness cmd/BonfyreMeter/tests/physical_attempt_test.sh proves that a receipt, physical-attempt identity, realization and occurrence time are mandatory for new usage, exact replay retains one event, and a changed payload under the same attempt is refused
  witness 2026-09-24 the retained full-estate meter has 461 receipt-bearing observations (443 priced at evidenced rates, 18 unpriced Cloudflare R2 syncs); its legacy rows retain no fabricated physical-attempt or realization coordinates and the public projection exposes that coverage explicitly
  witness 2026-09-29 scripts/tests/publish_economics_test.sh with BONFYRE_VERIFY_LEGACY=1 proves the Bun estate and subject-host pages reproduce the historical Python HTML byte-for-byte over priced and unpriced events, daily observations, receipts and program requirements
