architecture food-combination-graph
  canonical_name FoodCombinationGraph
  family economic
  domain Economic / Household Food Combination
  layer economic/food
  semantic_question Which source-bound food offers can be lawfully composed into exact cash, delayed-rebate, points, fulfillment, recipe-lead and travel-aware strategy dimensions?
  purpose Normalizes observed food offers and performs bounded native exact composition. It permits promotion composition only on explicit source-provided stack pairs; it projects recipe lexical leads without promoting them to substitution, availability, nutrition, or complete-basket facts. Its fulfillment route layer exhaustively binds cash-valued components to source-stated modes and order minima, with observed origins furnishing only geodesic travel lower bounds.
  maturity declared
  known_gap sources are archived (.archive) and the run8-r2c observation path is machine-local and absent; no live implementation exists
  owns FoodOfferObservation
  owns PromotionEffect
  owns QuantityPromotion
  owns FoodCombinationProjection
  owns RecipeReviewLead
  owns RecipeIngredientCoverage
  owns FulfillmentPlan
  consumes FinancialPosition
  consumes HouseholdRecipeObservation
  publishes FoodCombinationProjection
  node_types ObservedFoodOffer
  node_types PromotionEffect
  node_types QuantityPromotion
  node_types RecipeReviewLead
  node_types RecipeIngredientCoverage
  node_types FulfillmentPlan
  node_types RouteOrigin
  edge_types explicitly_stacks_with
  edge_types lexical_review_lead
  edge_types source_name_and_quantity_covers
  edge_types has_cash_basis
  edge_types fulfilled_by
  edge_types bound_to_origin
  invariant promotions combine only through source-declared compatible pairs
  invariant quantity promotions preserve qualifying/free identities, quantities, expiry, and stackability without allocating an unstated per-item cash value
  invariant bounded scalar basket replay refreshes every parsed offer and quantity law while limiting only two-/three-offer scalar candidates by an explicit deterministic cap
  invariant cash paid, delayed rebate and points remain separately basis-labelled
  invariant restaurant channel marks prepared-food observations without promoting them to complete meals or local availability
  invariant incomplete recipe coverage remains a review lead, never a meal total
  invariant recipe ingredient coverage requires a source-contained normalized name and explicit compatible package unit; leftover arithmetic never asserts waste
  invariant a basket that misses a source-stated fulfillment minimum has no plan in that mode
  invariant an unresolved fulfillment leg never supplies an exact cash total or zero travel
  forbidden_inference advertised price -> effective economic cost
  forbidden_inference recipe lexical match -> substitution or complete meal
  forbidden_inference points or rebate -> cash paid
  forbidden_inference quantity-promotion group total -> per-item cash value or checkout quote
  forbidden_inference bounded scalar replay frontier -> exhaustive strategy ranking, offer ineligibility, or inferior economics
  forbidden_inference geodesic travel lower bound -> road distance, drive time, or fuel cost
  source_path tools/food_offer_observations.py.archive
